@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Help";
}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

    <head>
        <title>Help</title>


        <!--Page-specific styles-->
        <style>
            #top {
                margin-bottom: 40px;
            }

            #help {
                margin-top: 60px;
            }

            h3 {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #2E557C;
            }

        </style>

    </head>


    <body>

       <div id="top">
            <h1>Help</h1>
            <i>Get help on how to use the application</i>
        </div>

        <div id="help">

            <h3>Creating and Editing a Lightsaber</h3>
            <p>
                To create a new Lightsaber, navigate to the "New Build" page and follow the prompts on screen.
                To edit a lightsaber you've made in the past, navigate to the "My Builds" page, click "edit"
                next to the Lightsaber you want, and follow the prompts.
                Similarly, to delete a Lightsaber, click the "Delete" button on the same page.
            </p>

            <br />
            <br />
            <br />
            <h3>Failed Saves or Pages not Loading</h3>
            <p>
                If a Lightsaber is not saving and showing to the "My Builds" page, ensure that you received the prompt
                "success" at the end of your build and that you left no fields blank. If this still occurs try restarting 
                the application, clear browser cache, or contact the developer.
                If certain pages do not load, try the steps stated above.
            </p>
        <br />
        <br />
        <br />
            <h3>Future Updates and More Information</h3>
            <p>
                This application likely will receive updates in the future as needed along with additional features.
                For more information, refer to the README document or contact the developer.
            </p>
        </div>


</body>

</html>